---
import ContentPage from '../components/ContentPage.astro';
const title = 'Disclaimer';
const description = 'Important information about using GradeWise results for academic planning.';
---

<ContentPage title={title} description={description} eyebrow="PLEASE NOTE">
  <h2>Educational calculation tools</h2>
  <p>GradeWise provides tools to help with educational calculations and planning. Results are estimates based on the information you enter and the assumptions shown by each calculator.</p>
  <p>Grading policies differ between courses and institutions. Before relying on a result, verify the inputs, weights, rounding rules, dropped scores, curves, and other policies against your official syllabus or with your institution.</p>
  <p>GradeWise does not guarantee a grade, passing result, or any other academic outcome. The tools do not replace official records, instructor guidance, or institutional grading decisions.</p>
</ContentPage>
